WEBVTT

00:00:00.980 --> 00:00:05.820
This 23-year-old white female presents with a complaint of allergies.

00:00:06.580 --> 00:00:11.760
She used to have allergies when she lived in Seattle, but she thinks they are worse here.

00:00:12.280 --> 00:00:15.500
In the past, she has tried Claritin and Zyrtec.

00:00:16.060 --> 00:00:19.500
Both worked for a short time, but then seemed to lose effectiveness.

00:00:20.380 --> 00:00:22.700
She had also used Allegra also.

00:00:23.600 --> 00:00:28.200
She used the Plasmur and she began using it again two weeks ago.

00:00:28.200 --> 00:00:36.320
It doesn't appear to be working very well. She has used over-the-counter sprays, but no prescription nasal sprays.

00:00:37.280 --> 00:00:49.360
She does have asthma, but doesn't require daily medication for this and does not think it is plaring up. Her only medication currently is Orthoticycline and Allegra.
